WEBVTT

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:40.350
<i>Episode 2</i>

00:01:46.970 --> 00:01:51.450
Ever since I married Prince Ye in Yunshang's
place, nothing good has happened to me.

00:01:51.450 --> 00:01:55.180
First, I was banished to that cold pavilion,
then mistaken for an assassin.

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:56.750
I've had enough!

00:01:56.750 --> 00:02:00.540
Well, it's all your fault. You had it
good on Spirit Cloud Mountain.

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:02.960
Hmph! Don't talk to me.

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:06.240
I haven't forgiven you for
abandoning me last night.

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:11.040
But if you do me a favor,
I'll consider forgiving you.

00:02:11.740 --> 00:02:13.530
Yeah? What kind of favor?

00:02:13.530 --> 00:02:16.390
Push me on the swing so I can save my strength.

00:02:22.630 --> 00:02:24.350
Faster! Faster!

00:02:25.970 --> 00:02:28.390
That's not high enough! Push harder!

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:33.100
Push harder!

00:02:34.510 --> 00:02:36.970
Not high enough! Come on, come on!

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:40.100
Haven't you had enough yet?

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:41.760
How's this, then?

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:44.260
Amazing!

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:48.140
<i>Who dares disturb the serenity
of the palace so brazenly?</i>

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:50.140
Don't stop! Keep going! Keep going!

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:53.640
<i>I must find out who would be so bold.
I will seize and discipline them.</i>

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:56.640
Amazing!

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:58.930
Who is playing so self-indulgently in the
Princely Palace in the middle of the... day?

00:02:59.190 --> 00:03:00.560
Let's do it again!

00:03:07.350 --> 00:03:11.510
Who is this, happily swinging by herself 
in this most venerable Princely Palace?

00:03:11.510 --> 00:03:15.180
<i>Wow, I can't believe such
a handsome man exists.</i>

00:03:19.850 --> 00:03:21.350
You want to swing too, my lord?

00:03:21.350 --> 00:03:23.520
You may swing first. I will wait.

00:03:23.520 --> 00:03:25.890
Oh, of course. We can hardly swing together.

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:28.940
Do not worry yourself. I will wait.

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:33.930
Hey, don't get all lovestruck!
I can't swing you both!

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:37.050
Oh, it was nice talking
to you, but it's getting late.

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:39.090
I have to go. Another time, perhaps.

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:41.390
Huh?

00:03:42.640 --> 00:03:43.520
But...

00:03:46.010 --> 00:03:46.760
Please wait.

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:47.970
Yes?

00:03:47.970 --> 00:03:50.720
Even though I cannot play
on the swing with you,

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:54.760
may we... still be friends?

00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:56.100
My name is Yu Zimo.

00:03:56.100 --> 00:03:57.820
Might I ask your name, miss?

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:05.880
What is the matter, miss? Are you all right?

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:09.010
I'm fine. Thanks for asking.

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:11.470
I'm a new handmaiden here. No one of note.

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:15.470
Your position here is immaterial.
There can be no harm in telling me your name.

00:04:17.140 --> 00:04:19.220
Hold it. I can't. Bye!

00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:25.820
As the old adage goes, not returning
what one receives is impolite.

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:29.640
I have told you my name, 
therefore, you must tell me yours.

00:04:40.390 --> 00:04:41.130
Miss!

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:46.700
What is your name?

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:51.770
You really wish to know it, my lord?

00:04:53.010 --> 00:04:56.100
Give me your name so that
we may meet again one day.

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:00.140
Fine.

00:05:00.740 --> 00:05:02.680
Don't ever forget...

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:05.760
My name is "Grandma"!

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:15.140
Step aside!

00:05:15.020 --> 00:05:17.060
Prince Ye is inside. You cannot enter.

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:16.870
Move out of my way!

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:18.300
What is it?

00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:20.370
It is me, Brother Ye.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:22.310
Unhand me.

00:05:23.180 --> 00:05:24.260
What are you doing?

00:05:25.060 --> 00:05:26.470
I desire a bath too.

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:33.870
My waist is sore, and my back hurts.
I require the water's soothing powers.

00:05:34.660 --> 00:05:36.180
Hm? What did you do?

00:05:36.590 --> 00:05:37.640
Nothing to deserve it.

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:41.560
On my way here, one of your handmaidens
performed a shoulder throw on me.

00:05:43.510 --> 00:05:45.940
Is there a maid so courageous in my palace?

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:48.180
I should promote her.

00:05:48.180 --> 00:05:49.140
Brother Ye...

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:51.300
Does your conscience not prick you?

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:52.220
Never.

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:54.850
Let me recount the story, dear brother.

00:05:54.850 --> 00:05:57.430
She was a curious young filly.

00:05:57.430 --> 00:05:59.680
It was the first time
I luxuriated in a shoulder throw.

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:01.520
I am happy for you.

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:04.800
Dear brother, you have never experienced
a shoulder throw, so you do not understand.

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:05.470
I do not wish to.

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:07.220
Brother Ye...

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:09.680
May I have that handmaiden?

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:10.970
What is her name?

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:14.510
All I know is that she is new here.

00:06:14.510 --> 00:06:19.430
As she is new, I will send you
all of my newly-hired maids.

00:06:19.430 --> 00:06:22.260
You are as generous as ever, Prince Ye!

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:26.220
Well, anyway, how are you these days?

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:30.180
I do not wish to discuss it. You know the truth.

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:34.850
Of course, but I hear she is the most beautiful
girl in the House of Grand Councilor.

00:06:34.850 --> 00:06:37.300
Many men have proposed to her,
but all were rejected.

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:39.940
And in the end, Father
arranged for her to marry you.

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:43.720
Do I take it... you are not fond of her?

00:06:45.220 --> 00:06:48.780
No. I am not. Did you have
a reason for you mentioning her?

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:52.180
Yes, I enjoy rubbing salt into the wound.

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:04.350
What about that matter
 I asked you to investigate?

00:07:04.350 --> 00:07:06.010
It was as you suspected.

00:07:06.010 --> 00:07:09.410
That sly old fox, Qian Aotian,
can no longer contain his impatience.

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:12.020
I would like to see...

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:14.600
...whether he can escape from my grasp.

00:07:15.510 --> 00:07:17.970
He has already passed the point of no return.

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:21.680
He should have known that this day
would come when he chose to be disloyal.

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:24.230
Once we have conclusive evidence,

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:28.520
I will make the whole Qian 
clan pay with their blood.

00:07:29.140 --> 00:07:32.740
Would that not also include your princess?

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:36.060
What a pity.

00:07:48.510 --> 00:07:51.470
If you ask me how much sorrow is in my heart,

00:07:51.470 --> 00:07:55.350
I will tell you it is like the
river flowing east: endless.

00:07:55.350 --> 00:07:57.970
<i>There is no escape from such sorrow.</i>

00:07:57.970 --> 00:08:01.180
<i>Just as I think it will depart my furrowed
brow, it creeps back into my heart.</i>

00:08:02.970 --> 00:08:05.070
Someone in the palace 
is as sorrowful as I am?

00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:07.280
A companion on the same sinking boat?

00:08:08.640 --> 00:08:11.100
Slicing water with a sword 
only makes it flow faster.

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:14.220
Drinking to drown my sorrow only deepens it.

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:16.600
<i>How strong the east wind,
how fleeting our happiness.</i>

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:21.140
<i>An anxious heart, apart for years.
Wrong, wrong, wrong.</i>

00:08:21.720 --> 00:08:24.350
Wrong, wrong, wrong. I am so wrong.

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:28.680
Why was I not told life could be
so hard as the wife of a prince?

00:08:30.850 --> 00:08:33.110
At a time like this, we need
comfort and embraces.

00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:37.970
We can embrace each other, back to back.

00:08:37.970 --> 00:08:40.220
Although the posture is so simple...

00:08:42.800 --> 00:08:45.860
..my arm is not long enough to embrace you.

00:08:50.350 --> 00:08:52.600
<i>For some reason, this doesn't feel right.</i>

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:58.300
Oh! You're a horse.

00:08:58.300 --> 00:08:59.770
You're a mare!

00:09:00.180 --> 00:09:01.680
<i>Oh! A human being.</i>

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:05.130
<i>My fellow human!</i>

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:05.130
My fellow horse!

00:09:09.470 --> 00:09:14.350
A long time ago, the prince would
eagerly ride me all day long.

00:09:14.350 --> 00:09:17.430
But nowadays, I don't see him
from one month to the next.

00:09:19.680 --> 00:09:22.220
What a jerk. He's so annoying,

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:23.470
I don't like him.

00:09:23.470 --> 00:09:27.510
Just move on. You're too cute for that
nasty buffoon. Why do you even like him?

00:09:27.510 --> 00:09:29.360
Find another master.

00:09:30.890 --> 00:09:32.550
It's not that easy.

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:33.970
It usually goes like this:

00:09:33.970 --> 00:09:37.890
Horses I like never show up,
and the ones that do are not my type.

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:40.270
Don't worry, I like you.

00:09:41.050 --> 00:09:43.390
I know some psychic tricks.

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:45.510
Let's hang out a lot in the future.

00:09:45.510 --> 00:09:47.270
My name is Qian Yunxi. What's yours?

00:09:48.510 --> 00:09:51.050
<i>My name, Succubus, sounds
like such a catty name.</i>

00:09:51.050 --> 00:09:53.990
<i>I don't want to tell her it.
What should I do? Help!</i>

00:09:56.600 --> 00:10:00.550
It doesn't matter what your name was.
What's important is your name from now on.

00:10:01.390 --> 00:10:06.470
I, Qian Yunxi, on behalf of Nyx, the goddess
of night, will give you a new name.

00:10:06.470 --> 00:10:12.050
From now on, your name will be: Crystal
Butterfly Q. Purple-Dream-Elegant-Snow.

00:10:12.050 --> 00:10:13.990
Otherwise known as Juliet.

00:10:15.390 --> 00:10:17.540
Will you be my Romeo?

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:18.970
Sure I will.

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:22.680
From this day forward, I will be
your eyes, your walking stick...

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:25.140
...and your Romeo.

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:28.600
<i>Don't call me Juliet just 
because you like me now,</i>

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:31.560
<i>then dump me when you find another horse.</i>

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:33.720
No, that won't happen, Juliet.

00:10:37.890 --> 00:10:40.180
Juliet, I'd like to ride you. May I?

00:10:40.680 --> 00:10:43.590
<i>Jump on and let me show you what I can do.</i>

00:10:47.010 --> 00:10:47.850
Love ya!

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:03.140
<i>Succubus is no ordinary horse.
She is extremely loyal.</i>

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:06.100
<i>She refuses to let anyone
ride her, except Brother Ye.</i>

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:08.850
<i>She never lets me approach her,
however I try to please her.</i>

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:12.180
<i>Who is that girl? Why has
Succubus not unseated her?</i>

00:11:16.600 --> 00:11:20.220
Stop! Who are you? Who gave you
 permission to ride that horse?

00:11:21.140 --> 00:11:22.260
Who are you?

00:11:22.260 --> 00:11:23.600
Why can't I ride this horse?

00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:24.850
Is this your horse?

00:11:24.850 --> 00:11:28.260
Yes. This is my horse and you 
are not allowed to ride her.

00:11:29.010 --> 00:11:31.780
<i>Romeo, he's lying to you. I am not his horse.</i>

00:11:35.350 --> 00:11:38.010
If you can prove it,
I'll give her back to you.

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:39.790
Fine. I shall prove it.

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:46.130
Here you go. Put on your show.

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:51.600
Succubus, for Brother Ye's sake,
please let me ride you today.

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:13.200
<i>Come and get me! I will let you
ride me if you can catch me.</i>

00:12:13.890 --> 00:12:17.140
This horse isn't yours at all. Liar.

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:21.180
You are so mean to me!

00:12:21.850 --> 00:12:24.180
What a nasty woman!

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:26.690
I'm telling Brother Ye!

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:31.110
Don't cry now. Get up.

00:12:35.300 --> 00:12:37.960
Let me teach you how to tame Juliet.

00:12:48.720 --> 00:12:50.050
Hey, Mochi.

00:12:50.050 --> 00:12:53.260
Get me some food quick. I'm starving!

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:55.810
Yunxi, welcome back.

00:12:58.060 --> 00:13:00.390
I rode a horse all afternoon, 
and now I'm tired and hungry.

00:13:00.390 --> 00:13:01.680
Help me find food...

00:13:01.680 --> 00:13:02.310
No, I won't.

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:04.810
I never asked you to ride a horse.

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:09.300
Mochi, what are you doing?

00:13:09.300 --> 00:13:11.390
It's not me. Don't blame me.

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:13.220
If it isn't you, who else could it be?

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:52.220
How dare you scare people!

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:52.220
How dare you scare a ghost!

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:56.300
Who are you? Tell us your name!

00:13:58.110 --> 00:13:59.800
My name is Sesame.

00:13:59.800 --> 00:14:02.930
I'm just a lonely ghost 
with a very low power level.

00:14:02.930 --> 00:14:05.490
Please forgive me.

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:13.710
We'll forgive you, but from now on,
you must serve us and tend to all our needs.

00:14:14.140 --> 00:14:20.140
That's no problem at all. I will do all I can,
from serving you food to giving massages.

00:14:20.600 --> 00:14:22.390
Do you know what you need to do now?

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:24.990
Yes. Please wait a moment.

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:34.300
This is great!

00:14:34.300 --> 00:14:36.470
You are ridiculously lucky.

00:14:36.470 --> 00:14:39.350
In spite of all your mishaps,
you always get your way.

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:40.550
Of course!

00:14:40.550 --> 00:14:43.520
I am the invincible, undefeated,
unbeatable Qian Yunxi.

00:14:45.260 --> 00:14:47.270
I want to take Auntie 
Xue and Que'er with me!

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:50.890
Husband, you cannot allow it.
More people equals more trouble.

00:14:51.430 --> 00:14:55.260
If they all go, the risk of exposure increases.

00:14:55.260 --> 00:15:00.020
Furthermore, they signed
a life contract with us.

00:14:58.800 --> 00:15:00.020
My lady...

00:15:00.020 --> 00:15:02.800
You want them? Do you have 
the money to pay for them?

00:15:03.730 --> 00:15:05.930
Do not worry about us, my lady.

00:15:05.930 --> 00:15:08.390
We have been working here a long time.

00:15:08.390 --> 00:15:11.760
They will not treat us badly.
Please do not worry.

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:15.220
You need to take care of yourself, my lady.

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:18.130
Come back and visit us when you have time.

00:15:27.680 --> 00:15:29.050
My lady...

00:15:43.220 --> 00:15:45.850
Auntie Xue... Que'er...

00:15:51.310 --> 00:15:53.800
Why are you screaming
so early in the morning?

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:56.010
What's wrong, Mistress Yunxi?

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:59.050
What is it? Tell us what's got you down.

00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:02.940
It'll entertain us— I mean,
so we can share the burden.

00:16:03.700 --> 00:16:07.560
I had a nightmare that Auntie Xue and
Que'er were being treated appallingly.

00:16:08.090 --> 00:16:12.680
Don't worry, Mistress Yunxi.
Dreams are the opposite of reality.

00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:14.310
Sesame is right.

00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:17.390
I know, but I'm still worried.

00:16:18.350 --> 00:16:22.010
Aren't you bored here?
No one cares about you in this place.

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:23.720
Why not sneak home and check it out?

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:27.140
Exactly what I was thinking.
No time like the present.

00:16:27.890 --> 00:16:31.640
But I <i>am</i> still a princess.
I need to disguise myself.

00:16:36.770 --> 00:16:39.310
Did I not give you the maids you desired?

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:41.510
I desire the one who threw 
me over her shoulder.

00:16:41.510 --> 00:16:44.350
You must have kept her for 
yourself, due to her beauty.

00:16:45.680 --> 00:16:48.760
General Xuan and I are 
discussing the Western Tribe.

00:16:48.760 --> 00:16:49.720
Stop your games.

00:16:50.930 --> 00:16:52.470
Western Tribe?

00:16:52.470 --> 00:16:55.470
But Father assigned Qian 
Aotian to deal with them.

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:57.680
You heard so too?

00:16:57.970 --> 00:16:58.920
Indeed.

00:16:59.390 --> 00:17:01.680
The Western Tribe have
been acting up lately.

00:17:03.050 --> 00:17:07.020
Father trusts Qian Aotian. Naturally, 
he sent him to solve the problem.

00:17:09.220 --> 00:17:13.170
But Qian Aotian's relationship
with the Western Tribe is suspect.

00:17:14.080 --> 00:17:15.890
Examine our wares!

00:17:15.890 --> 00:17:18.330
Take a look at our homemade cloth!

00:17:18.690 --> 00:17:20.410
Fresh meat!
